WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.967
Module 12 moves from advanced one-statement analysis to reusable SQL interfaces.

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:13.332
You will work with views and modular query design so frequently used logic does not have to be rewritten in

00:00:13.332 --> 00:00:15.972
every analysis.

00:00:15.972 --> 00:00:22.912
The CTE habits from this module will help because good views also depend on clear grain, clear naming,

00:00:22.912 --> 00:00:31.792
and understandable transformation logic. As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:31.792 --> 00:00:37.727
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:41.120
and the meaning of each transformation.
